<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage jumps above 10 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage jumps above 10 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage jumped over one billion rand on Monday to rise to 10.256 billion rand from 9.048 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
